# Lip-trick tapping: one lip trick per air. Straight up the vert ramp at 10 m/s, I tapped every 4
# ticks at the coping: one Rock to Fakie, then the drop back in and the landing (tapping again
# used to stall on the coping again each time: 30 lip tricks and 30,840 points in one air).
park lab
spawn lab_vert
cmd 6 speed 10
tap grind 244..364 every 4
run 600
expect event lipStart count == 1
expect event lipStart{trick=Rock to Fakie} within 243..247
expect event lipEnd{trick=Rock to Fakie,reason=drop in} within 244..249
expect event land{fakie=true} within 319..323
expect event comboLanded{name=Rock to Fakie,points=202} within 330..334
expect no event bail
